 "intro_zh": "萍乡市武功山景区属湘赣边界罗霄山脉北段，历史上曾与庐山、衡山并称江南三大名山，有“衡首庐尾武功中”之称。武功山景区由金顶景区、羊狮幕景区、九龙山、发云界四大区块组成，其中武功山主峰白鹤峰（金顶）海拔1918.3米。",
 "intro_en": "The Wugongshan or Wu-kung Mountains (Chinese: 武功山), now a tourist resort, are a range of mountains located in the west of Jiangxi, China. It is the geography boundary of Anfu County, Luxi County, Jiangxi, Yichun, Jiangxi, and Lianhua County. Its highest point, the 1918.3-meter high Baihe Feng (Golden Peak) located in Anfu County.",
 "intro_en_source": "wikipedia",
